          <div class="vb-widget-container"><p><em>Structured, Practical, Measurable</em></p></div>
        </div>
        <div
          class="vb-element vb-element-4813f50 vb-widget vb-widget-text-editor"
          data-id="4813f50"
          data-element_type="widget"
          data-e-type="widget"
          data-widget_type="text-editor.default"
        >
          <div class="vb-widget-container">
            <p>
              <span style="font-weight: 400;"
                >At VentureBean, we combine our proprietary PPTG model with a robust Six Sigma–based DMAIC coaching
                framework to deliver a coaching experience that is strategic, highly structured, and results-driven
                through</span
              ><span style="font-weight: 400;">.</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">
                This integrated methodology ensures that every coaching engagement is tailored to individual and team
                development needs, linked to organisational objectives and goals, anchored in data, tracked for
                measurable, time-bound impact.</span>
            </p><p>
              <span style="font-weight: 400;"
                >By weaving together operational excellence and human capital enhancement, we enable leaders to navigate
                complexity, manage change effectively, and build scalable systems that foster continuous
                improvement.&nbsp;</span>
            </p><p>
              <span style="font-weight: 400;"
                >Our approach sharpens performance and enhances accountability, alignment, and long-term success across
                functions and leadership levels.&nbsp;</span>
            </p><p>
              <span style="font-weight: 400;"
                >Whether you’re a CXO, a functional head, or a founder scaling your venture, our coaching model empowers
                you to grow with clarity, confidence, and consistency.</span>
            </p>
          </div>
